      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "A rare case of right atrial thrombosis was observed in a 49-year-old woman. She had cyanotic ostium secundum atrial septal defect without pulmonary hypertension. By postoperative cardiac catheterization, she was diagnosed as having isolated right ventricular hypoplasia."},
